where, as humans, we

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.944
rely a lot on what we
previously said to figure out

00:10:42.944 --> 00:10:43.860
what we will say next.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:44.790
JUSTIN ZHAO: Mm-hmm.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:45.385
exactly.

00:10:45.385 --> 00:10:47.840
YUFENG GUO: So let's talk
